SrcIp IN ("1.*", "2.*", "3.*", "4.*", "5.*", "6.*", "7.*", "8.*", "9.*") UriStem IN ("*/login*", "*/signin*", "*/auth*", "*/account*", "*/user*", "*/users*", "*/password*", "*/forgot*", "*/reset*") UriQuery IN ("*user=*", "*username=*", "*email=*", "*login=*", "*account=*", "*upn=*", "*principal=*") Method IN ("GET", "POST") UserAgent IN ("*curl*", "*wget*", "*python*", "*go-http-client*", "*httpclient*", "*axios*", "*requests*", "*scanner*", "*probe*") Status IN (401, 403, 404) NOT (UserAgent IN ("*Mozilla*", "*Chrome*", "*Firefox*", "*Safari*", "*Edge*") OR UriStem IN ("*/sso*", "*/oauth*", "*/openid*", "*/saml*", "*/idp*", "*/federation*") OR UserAgent IN ("*nessus*", "*qualys*", "*openvas*", "*acunetix*", "*nuclei*", "*zabbix*", "*prometheus*", "*uptime*", "*pingdom*", "*datadog*", "*newrelic*") OR UriStem IN ("*.css", "*.js", "*.png", "*.jpg", "*.svg", "*.ico", "*.woff", "*.woff2")) | table SrcIp,Method,UriStem,UriQuery,Status,UserAgent
